Z||000000||sqoach||10-01-2001||08:43 PM||||I was getting tired of having silver fenders and a white spoiler on my gold SE (not to mention the primer grey and red cracked/warped nose). Well, I bought a few cans of the closest color I could find and went to work. Didn't take the time I should have prepping, but this is just a temporary fix until the whole car gets painted. And I had to paint outside because I have no garage (stupid bugs and dust!) The color is very close, maybe just a shade darker/golder. Anyway, it looks better. Now I just need to get a bra for the nose (hint hint)  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/biggrin.gif"><P>------------------<BR>-Adam<BR><FONT COLOR="BLUE">sqoach@yahoo.com</FONT><BR>            <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/sqoach.gif">         <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/fullstaff.gif">            <BR>^^^^^^<B>new project</B>^^^^^^<BR><LI><FONT SIZE="1">84 SE (FOR SALE)*SOLD*<BR><LI>85 Coupe (parts car)($50)*sale pending*<BR><LI>86 SC</FONT>||||reg||10
