Z||000002||sqoach||10-02-2001||03:01 PM|||| <BLOCKQUOTE><font size="1" face="Verdana, Arial, Helvetica">quote:</font><HR>Originally posted by Monkeyman:<BR><B>How about some pics???</B><HR></BLOCKQUOTE><P>Here's a before and after the paint.<BR> <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/6_7.jpg"> <P> <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/7_4.jpg"> <P>You can see how the fenders are a little darker than the rest. You can't tell on the spoiler in this pic, though. I might go back and wet-sand the fenders. But that's pretty close for just a can of spray paint. I also painted the ground f/x with some flat black, as you can see. Now she just needs a bra.  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/smile.gif">||||reg||1
Z||000003||mrfixit58||10-02-2001||03:16 PM||||And you installed the super rare sunroof ladder option, too! Cool!  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/wink.gif"><P>Seriously, don't try to sand the paint unless you used a clear coat. Metallics don't sand well but,if you clear coat is can be done.<BR><P>------------------<BR>Roy  :D <BR>Just another stock Blue 87 GT   <BR>   <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/pennocksize.JPG">      <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/fullstaff.gif"> ||||reg||14
