Z||000006||sqoach||10-02-2001||09:12 PM|||| <BLOCKQUOTE><font size="1" face="Verdana, Arial, Helvetica">quote:</font><HR>Originally posted by mrfixit58:<BR><B>And you installed the super rare sunroof ladder option, too! Cool!   <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/wink.gif"><P>Seriously, don't try to sand the paint unless you used a clear coat. Metallics don't sand well but,if you clear coat is can be done.<P><BR></B><HR></BLOCKQUOTE><P>Yeah, that's very helpful when I'm hi-jacking 18-wheelers and such  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/smile.gif"><BR>(ok, sorry, bad joke)<BR>Actually, we've been working on our roof. We're putting up new shingles. Just knocked off for the day. Talk about fun work  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/rolleyes.gif"><P>I still need to do the hood. It's gold, but it's faded pretty badly. I'll wait til I get a hood scoop to do that, though. And I found a bra! Woohoo! Goldie will be so happy  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/biggrin.gif"><BR>||||reg||1
